  "c8ee79b9-d1d7-784c-a89b-6079f2b5c133"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the noise sigma based on the tensor residual. If \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["blur", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "720e8f4f-1767-ac4f-a987-8358e135fe4d"],
